{"id":"66b3ab8406681395","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-compositional-truth.md","title":"无扩展归纳的组合真理 CT减","display":"df-compositional-truth — 无扩展归纳的组合真理 CT减","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-compositional-truth","aliases":["91-df-compositional-truth"],"display":"df-compositional-truth — 无扩展归纳的组合真理 CT减","depends_on":["[[91-df-compositional-axioms]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-compositional-truth"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-compositional-truth</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-compositional-truth — 无扩展归纳的组合真理 CT减"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b0b2a8b496dd82c3\" href=\"?note=b0b2a8b496dd82c3\" title=\"91-df-compositional-axioms\">91-df-compositional-axioms</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 为基础算术；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\">\\(\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\)</span> 是下述理论的名称。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Comp}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Comp}}\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b0b2a8b496dd82c3\" href=\"?note=b0b2a8b496dd82c3\" title=\"91-df-compositional-axioms\">91-df-compositional-axioms</a> 的六个编码量化公理。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\)</span> 是扩展语言中的经典一阶演绎闭包；PA 仅有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_0\">\\(\\mathcal L_0\\)</span> 归纳。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}compositional\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(\\mathrm{PA}\\cup\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Comp}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}compositional\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(\\mathrm{PA}\\cup\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Comp}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本目录沿用常见 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\">\\(\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\)</span> 记号，对应原书 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ct}\\upharpoonright\">\\(\\mathrm{ct}\\upharpoonright\\)</span>。完整 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CT}\">\\(\\mathrm{CT}\\)</span> 在 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4e1e503ea918b41a\" href=\"?note=4e1e503ea918b41a\" title=\"91-df-CT\">91-df-CT</a> 加入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_T\\)</span> 归纳。\nTheorem 8.5 证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\">\\(\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\)</span> 对 PA 保守；这不意味着每个 PA 模型都能直接添加满足类。2014 修订版已撤回初版中的错误消切证明，不能把那段证明作为已验证依据。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 8.3 与 Theorem 8.5，印刷页 65–69，PDF 页 76–80。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-compositional-axioms","status":"resolved","id":"b0b2a8b496dd82c3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-compositional-axioms]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-compositional-axioms","status":"resolved","id":"b0b2a8b496dd82c3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Comp}}$ 为 [[91-df-compositional-axioms]] 的六个编码量化公理。","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-CT","status":"resolved","id":"4e1e503ea918b41a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"本目录沿用常见 $\\mathrm{CT}^{-}$ 记号，对应原书 $\\mathrm{ct}\\upharpoonright$。完整 $\\mathrm{CT}$ 在 [[91-df-CT]] 加入 $\\mathcal L_T$ 归纳。\nTheorem 8.5 证明 $\\mathrm{CT}^{-}$ 对 PA 保守；这不意味着每个 PA 模型都能直接添加满足类。2014 修订版已撤回初版中的错误消切证明，不能把那段证明作为已验证依据。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Comp}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}compositional\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(\\mathrm{PA}\\cup\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Comp}}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ct}\\upharpoonright","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CT}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}","display":false}],"bytes":1346,"backlinks":[{"id":"4e1e503ea918b41a","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"73ccb673e6681e3d","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f32c7d95792dcee2","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-compositional-truth]]"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-30","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-compositional-truth]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-24","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-ari